      "message": "This + removing the label in the tree above implicitly assumes no one will accidentally include another node of this compat in the devicetree, even one that\u0027s disabled.\n\nI think we should keep a label for this particular node. But I could very well be wrong, is there a design artifact/discussion you can point me to on comparing the usage of `DT_INST(0..)` versus `DT_NODELABEL()` for the using a single node use-case?",
